  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "きけんを　さっちするとけっしょうの　はなびらを　ひらいて　えんすいけいのからだから　ビームを　はっしゃする。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "위험을 감지하면 결정으로 된 꽃잎을 펼친 뒤 원뿔 모양의 몸에서 빔을 발사한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "只要察覺到危險，就會張開結晶的花瓣，從圓錐形的身體發射光束。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Lorsqu’il détecte un danger, il ouvre ses pétales cristallins et son corps conique tire un rayon laser.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Erkennt es Gefahr, öffnet es seine kristallenen Blütenblätter, um aus seinem kegelförmigen Körper Strahlen abzufeuern.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "En cuanto percibe peligro, abre sus pétalos de cristal y despide rayos por su cuerpo en forma de cono.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se avverte un pericolo, schiude i petali di cristallo ed emette dei raggi dal suo corpo conico.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "When this Pokémon detects danger, it will open up its crystalline petals and fire beams from its conical body.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "危険を　察知すると結晶の　花びらを　開いて　円錐形の体から　ビームを　発射する。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "只要感应到危险，就会张开结晶的花瓣，从圆锥形的身体发射光束。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "En cuanto percibe peligro, abre sus pétalos de cristal y despide rayos por su cuerpo en forma de cono.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "どくエネルギーが　けっしょうかした　はなびらはテラスタルの　ほうせきに　にているとさいきん　はんめいした。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "독 에너지가 결정화한 꽃잎은 테라스탈의 보석을 닮은 것으로 최근에 밝혀졌다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "最近發現牠的毒能量結晶化後所形成的花瓣與太晶的寶石類似。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "On a récemment découvert que ses pétales constitués d’énergie toxique cristallisée ressemblent à des Joyaux Téracristal.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Vor Kurzem wurde festgestellt, dass seine Blütenblätter, die aus kristallisierter toxischer Energie bestehen, Terakristallen ähneln.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sus pétalos están hechos de energía venenosa cristalizada. Recientemente se ha puesto de manifiesto su parecido con las joyas Teracristal.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Recentemente è emerso che i suoi petali fatti di energia Veleno cristallizzata sono affini alle pietre preziose del fenomeno Teracristal.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Glimmora’s petals are made of crystallized poison energy. It has recently become evident that these petals resemble Tera Jewels.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "毒エネルギーが　結晶化した　花びらはテラスタルの　宝石に　似ていると最近　判明した。",
      "language": {
